Z||000003||fiero56||07-09-2001||10:14 PM||||Watch for them thar tornado things when your in Xenia thir Roger.<P>I think I met the guy(s) who do those re-bodys last year in C'vill when they took one of their works-in-progress out to dinner. Someone had yanked the dist(the rear window on their F-40 wasn't installed yet) and they had no idea where TCD was to re-install. I happened to be driving by so gave them a hand. I might still have one of their business cards around(they haul stuff as I re-call). They seemed a bit "shady" to me though.||||reg||1
